  "prefLabel": "Adm 1003.04 Defendant's Obligation to Review Financial Statement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 1003.04 Defendant's Obligation to Review Financial Statement. If the financial statement has been prepared by or with the assistance of court staff the defendant shall, before it is presented to the presiding judge to be signed to order appointment of counsel or other defense services or expenses, review all information contained therein and either confirm the accuracy of that information or make any necessary corrections.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 1000) #8697, eff 8-3-06; ss by #10728, eff 11-25-14; ss by #13050, eff 7-1-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/adm1000.html"
